OL,3,CHuge fires threaten to tear through
OL,4,Chomes in Stoke and the West Midlands
OL,6,FHuge fires have threatened to tear
OL,7,Fthrough homes in Stoke and in the West
OL,8,FMidlands after dramatic footage
OL,9,Fcirculating online showed enormous
OL,10,Fflames coming from homes, buildings
OL,11,Fand a golf course.
OL,13,FWest Midlands Fire Service said it was
OL,14,Ffacing "extreme levels of demand" due
OL,15,Fto a fire in Stourbridge on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe "extensive grass fire" follows
OL,18,Fscorching temperatures across the
OL,19,Fregion and other parts of the UK.
OL,26,@vD@HOUvD@aO]yD@EOUyD@ZO]
