OL,3,CHuge fires threaten to tear through
OL,4,Chomes in Stoke and the West Midlands
OL,6,FMeanwhile, a major incident has been
OL,7,Fdeclared due to a "large fire" in
OL,8,FStratford-on-Avon, with residents
OL,9,Furged to close all doors and windows.
OL,11,FWarwickshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fwere called at 2.30pm on Thursday to
OL,13,Freports of a large plume of smoke on
OL,14,FTothall Lane, Salford Priors in
OL,15,FStratford-on-Avon.
OL,17,F"On arrival crews discovered a
OL,18,Fwildfire which was spreading to nearby
OL,19,Fout-buildings," they said.
OL,26,@oD@SOUoD@^O]{D@OO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786717110
OL,3,CHuge fires threaten to tear through
OL,4,Chomes in Stoke and the West Midlands
OL,6,F"There are currently 10 appliances in
OL,7,Fattendance. This incident has been
OL,8,Fdeclared a major incident.
OL,10,F"We would like to express that there
OL,11,Fis a large emergency presence in the
OL,12,Farea and we continue to advise
OL,13,Fresidents nearby to close all doors
OL,14,Fand windows.
OL,16,F"Please stay away from the area. Our
OL,17,Fcontrol room is receiving a large
OL,18,Fnumber of calls, so please contact us
OL,19,Fonly in a genuine emergency.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786717110
OL,3,CHuge fires threaten to tear through
OL,4,Chomes in Stoke and the West Midlands
OL,6,F"It's imperative that residents take
OL,7,Fall steps to reduce any fire risk.
OL,8,FPlease read advice on our social media
OL,9,Fchannels about fire and water safety.
OL,11,F"West Midlands Ambulance Service and
OL,12,FWarwickshire Police are also on scene."
OL,14,FElsewhere, a huge plume of black smoke
OL,15,Fcan be seen coming from the Sandyford
OL,16,Farea in Stoke.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
