CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786717110
OL,3,CHuge fires threaten to tear through
OL,4,Chomes in Stoke and the West Midlands
OL,6,FStaffordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fhas confirmed residents have been
OL,8,Fevacuated in the city - with more
OL,9,Ffamilies possibly asked to leave their
OL,10,Fhomes as the incident develops.
OL,12,FA spokesperson said: "We are currently
OL,13,Fat the scene of a large fire in the
OL,14,FGoldenhill area of Stoke-on-Trent. A
OL,15,Fsmall number of residents from Sandy
OL,16,FRoad area have been evacuated while
OL,17,Fcrews attend the scene.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/6
