OL,3,CHuge fires threaten to tear through
OL,4,Chomes in Stoke and the West Midlands
OL,6,F"Further evacuations may take place in
OL,7,Fdue course. People are urged to avoid
OL,8,Fthe area and close their windows and
OL,9,Fdoors as a precaution."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/6
